OL,3,GNEWSAStriking skies and autumnal hues
OL,4,Aas October begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FOctober's arrival is marked by
OL,7,Fshortening days and colourful clouds,
OL,8,Fand with the turning of the seasons
OL,9,Fcomes a whole new colour palette for
OL,10,Fthe North East and Cumbria.
OL,12,FAs always, our BBC Weather Watchers
OL,13,Fhave been out and about capturing the
OL,14,Fscenes.
OL,16,FHere are some of our favourite snaps.
OL,18,FFind out how to join in with Weather
OL,19,FWatchers here. Or send your photos to
OL,20,FLook North.
